# A token copy of a Doomed Traveler has its dies ability (CR 707.2, 111.1). The Fire Crystal copies the Traveler on turn 3 and
# sacrifices the token at the beginning of the next end step (CR 603.7): the token goes to the graveyard (a death, CR 700.4)
# and then ceases to exist (CR 111.7), and "When this creature dies" still makes a 1/1 white flying Spirit for Bot1. The real
# Traveler is untouched, the graveyard stays empty (the token is no card), and the Spirit is a token.
# Turn 1: the Moxen are free; Pearl's {W} casts the Traveler, Mountain + Ruby (R R) + Jet + Sapphire pay the Crystal.
# Turn 3: both Mountains and four Moxen pay {4}{R}{R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
The Fire Crystal
Doomed Traveler
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

